	(text_box "VM stepped down to ~2.2V. ENABLE requires 1.5V enable, but left at 2.2V to account for changes in bus voltage.\nENABLE is usually pulled to GND and DRV is activated with 8-20us pulse from MCU\n\nCapacitor is to prevent any spikes due to parastic inductance. Debatable if this is neccesary but its an easy addition"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
